00:07:27.370 --> 00:07:28.580
No, I didn't know that.

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.319
"Did you know that Michael Jordan one season
averaged 3.8 steals a game?"

00:07:31.319 --> 00:07:32.440
I didn't know that.

00:07:32.440 --> 00:07:35.380
"Did you know Michael Jordan one season averaged
