00:08:11.880 --> 00:08:13.610
So share, teach.

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:16.220
So share helps, teach helps even more.

00:08:16.220 --> 00:08:18.860
Both of them help you retain information.

00:08:18.860 --> 00:08:21.280
#6:Let's get to the next one here.

00:08:21.280 --> 00:08:24.669
The next one is, link it to stories.

00:08:24.669 --> 00:08:26.419
Whatever you learn, link it to a story.

00:08:26.419 --> 00:08:28.530
It doesn't matter what it is.

00:08:28.530 --> 00:08:29.530
Link it to a story.

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:37.449
So if you retain information and you read
a book about Teddy Roosevelt's first wife

00:08:37.449 --> 00:08:43.949
